<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0a192f"><meta name="description" content="<%= description %>"><meta property="og:title" content="<%= title %>"><meta property="og:description" content="<%= description %>"><link rel="canonical" href="https://coft-teal.vercel.app/journal"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary"><title><%= title %></title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/portfolio.css"></head>
<body><a class="skip-link" href="#content">Skip to content</a><header class="site-header page-site-header"><div class="header-inner"><a class="wordmark" href="/"><span class="wordmark-mark">F</span><span>faith<span class="wordmark-dot">.</span></span></a><nav class="primary-nav page-nav" aria-label="Page navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/#work">Work</a><a href="/mobile">Mobile</a><a href="/#contact">Contact</a></nav></div></header>
<main id="content" class="page-width detail-page"><a class="back-link" href="/">← Back home</a><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> NOTES FROM THE BUILD PROCESS</p><h1 class="subpage-title">The engineering<br><em>journal.</em></h1><p class="subpage-intro">Ideas, technical decisions and lessons from building software. These are learning notes, not claims of expertise—written to make the reasoning behind the work visible.</p>
