</main><footer class="site-footer page-width"><a class="wordmark" href="/"><span class="wordmark-mark">F</span><span>faith<span class="wordmark-dot">.</span></span></a><p>Designed & built by Faith Toluwanimi.</p><span>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %></span><a href="#content" class="back-top">Back to top ↑</a></footer></body></html>
